+/* romdev (0.80.0): the m68k read/write hooks call the shared romdev_debug.c.
+ * ROMDEV_WP_M68K is the WRITE hook (watchpoint + range-write); ROMDEV_RD_M68K the
+ * READ hook (read-watch + range-read). The shared lib reports a hit (return 1) and the
+ * m68k takes its register snapshot — romdev_m68k_snap fills romdev_snap_regs[] with the
+ * m68k layout (D0-D7,A0-A7,PC,SR,SP). The PC reported is romdev_m68k_instr_pc (the
+ * EXECUTING instruction's first byte, latched at dispatch — REG_PC has prefetched
+ * past the operands by write time). ROMDEV_RANGE_M68K is folded into on_write/on_read
