+/* romdev register read/write — the inverse of getCPUState, used by the host's
+ * callSubroutine / decompressWith (set args + PC=entry, push a sentinel return,
+ * run to it, capture the output). gpgx emulates TWO CPUs: the m68k (Genesis) and
+ * the Z80 (SMS/GG/Mark III). We dispatch on the loaded system: `system_hw`
+ * (declared in system.h via shared.h) carries SYSTEM_MD/SYSTEM_PBC for Genesis
+ * and SYSTEM_SMS/SYSTEM_GG/etc for the 8-bit machines. The idiom used throughout
